      "Three ordinal SSBO/push116 exact; requireA/D mask5 with optionalB within7, because unused multiply=false can eliminate binding1 reads. Priorhelper does not report exactmask; newfixture will. vnum_ssbos3 dueinterface highestbinding2.",
      "No new ABI/NIR/classification/cache field. Existing batch_local_memory serialized in meta_a survives import; driver build-ID invalidatesoldUUID. Arithmetic/native shaders untouched.",
